|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
| law_commit_attempt | 5053.625 | 5154.625 | 0.9804 | 64 | one judged Attempt insert per commit under the full law roster (key + containment + capacity) |
| law_commit_cluster | 5206.625 | 4677.083 | 1.1132 | 256 | one judged 4-row cluster per commit: attempt + verdict + steer + scope — every statement family exercised in one commit |
| law_reject_key | 4562.500 | 14.625 | 311.9658 | 64 | one REFUSED duplicate-(task, n) commit per sample (Functionality cited) |
